BaseSettler_lookupFillerEscrow
├── when the concrete is PartialFillSettler AND no fillerRollovers entry exists for the pair
│   └── it should return a zero FillerEscrow with filler address zero
├── when the concrete is PartialFillSettler AND a fillerRollovers entry exists for the pair
│   └── it should return the escrow mapped from _fillerRollovers including srcCstProvided and dstCstProduced
├── when the concrete is ExactFillSettler AND no fillRecords entry exists for the orderId
│   └── it should return a zero FillerEscrow with dstCstProduced zero and filledAt zero
└── when the concrete is ExactFillSettler AND a fillRecords entry exists for the orderId
    └── it should return the escrow mapped from the rollover-output-hash FillRecord including dstCstProduced and filledAt
